direction_1155 = location "Stone Golem" about "Stone Golem\nAncient Priests were able to give power to stones and made slaves. These slaves were called Stone Golems. After Patos War, Stone Golems were able to freely attack anyone they want as priests power has been decreased." found "Karus Eslant" karus at 198 143 in zone 11

On available
    Say "Asking for, but the last mission I've ever seen. Come to the last look!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Now secured the last one place, friendly forces will be able to enter."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Geez ...Not be obtained at this time residing in the driveway ... [Stone Golem], they. Are going to be a tough fight.\n\nDefeat [Stone Golum]."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Please cheer up a little bit more. It is a little bit now."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_1155
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Please cheer up a little bit more. It is a little bit now."

On ready
    Say "Oh, she's all down! I lost a stout, solid guys."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Embraced complete secure! Now, it's the end of my mission! Lot of trouble as well.\n\nNow the ones to report that [Ascetic] Beda God now secured in the driveway. Lot of trouble as well. I reside here until friendly forces arrive and we will continue to look to the war situation."
